    "description": "The slot machine above the prompt: your chips. \"/jackpot spin|golden|demo\" to try it.",
    "output": "◉ 0  ×1  ▲ 0  ✦ 1  ♛ 0\n0 spins, best win 0.\nEvery finished turn pulls the lever. A medium moment (a commit, a skill, a sent message) earns a golden spin (better odds, double pay); a big one (a merge, a deploy, a finished task list, a PDF made) earns 3. Five clean turns in a row raise the multiplier, up to ×5; a tool error resets it.\n\nPreview a move (practice, nothing counts):\n  /jackpot spin  a practice pull\n  /jackpot golden  a golden spin (medium or big moment)\n  /jackpot demo  a jackpot\n\n/jackpot reset starts this game over in this terminal (it asks first)."
